WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.611
Welcome to our video, Brand Guide for Global Amazon Selling Partners, with step-by-step brand transfer

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:07.000
guidance.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.684
In this video, we'll explore how to transfer your brand to your new store, the benefits that come

00:00:12.684 --> 00:00:13.000
along,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
the brand protection tools at your disposal, and the exciting incentives that await you.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Let's dive in!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.588
Amazon Brand Registry is a program designed by Amazon to help brand owners protect their registered

00:00:26.588 --> 00:00:27.000
trademarks,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
and create an accurate and trusted experience for customers.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
With Brand Registry, you have a powerful toolkit at your disposal.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.533
You can safeguard your intellectual property, engage with millions of customers, target high-intent

00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:43.000
shoppers,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
and make data-driven decisions for your brand's success.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.600
If you are a brand owner in your home store, you can transfer your brand registry to the store you

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.000
want to start selling in.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.615
But how?

00:00:54.615 --> 00:00:58.000
Let me walk you through the steps you need to follow.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.650
Please log in to your new store's Seller Central Account, go to Settings, click on Account Info,

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.000
then Merchant Token.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Copy, paste your merchant token, then log in to your existing brand registry account,

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.000
from the primary brand registry login or Seller Central.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Navigate to Brand Registry Support, update your brand profile, and fix related issues to user roles.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Once finished, you will be directed to fill out a template.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Please fill out the template with the following details.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:39.111
Please add Merchant Token to your brand registry account for benefits of A+ content, brand stores,

00:01:39.111 --> 00:01:40.000
and Vine.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.579
Please be aware, brand registry accounts are internal to the registered brand owners and not resellers

00:01:47.579 --> 00:01:49.000
or authorized distributors.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.652
Then enter the primary user email address used to register the new Seller Central account that you

00:01:55.652 --> 00:01:58.000
are wanting to give permissions to.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.261
Enter the brands you want the account associated with, which is case-sensitive, which means that

00:02:04.261 --> 00:02:07.000
distinctions matter between capital and small letters.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:13.667
Your application will be sent to Brand Registry Seller Support for review, and they will confirm

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:17.000
its success or request more information, if necessary.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:23.182
Don't hesitate to reach out to Brand Registry Support whenever you need a helping hand in navigating

00:02:23.182 --> 00:02:25.000
your brand's journey on Amazon.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Your success is our priority, and we're here to support you every step of the way.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:37.000
Once you are done transferring your brand and start selling on your new store, you can focus on

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.000
growing your brand.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:45.619
Amazon provides you with an exclusive set of tools designed to help enhance conversion rates, boost

00:02:45.619 --> 00:02:48.000
discoverability, and foster customer engagement.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:54.818
Moreover, Amazon equips you with valuable data through tools such as Amazon Brand Analytics, empowering

00:02:54.818 --> 00:02:58.000
you to make data-driven strategic decisions.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:04.188
For further details on Amazon Brand Growth Tools, please visit www.

00:03:04.188 --> 00:03:04.750
brandservices.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.312
amazon.

00:03:05.312 --> 00:03:07.000
com/grow-brand.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:13.533
While we've discussed the fundamentals of brand growth, it's equally important to address brand

00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:14.000
protection.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.667
Protecting your brand in all stores is crucial.

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:25.000
As you explore your new store, Amazon equips you with essential tools and programs like Transparency,

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:32.000
which is a product serialization service that helps identify individual units and proactively prevents

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.000
counterfeits from reaching customers.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.379
Project Zero, which combines Amazon's advanced technology, machine learning, and innovation with

00:03:39.379 --> 00:03:46.552
the sophisticated knowledge that brands have of their own intellectual property on how to best detect

00:03:46.552 --> 00:03:47.000
counterfeits.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:54.286
IP Accelerator, which is a feature that connects brands with a network of law firms that specialise

00:03:54.286 --> 00:03:56.000
in intellectual property law

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:03.000
and provides early access to brand registry to those brands that consequently file trademark applications.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.087
And counterfeit Crimes Unit, which works with brands, law enforcement, and customers across the

00:04:09.087 --> 00:04:13.000
globe to stop bad actors and hold them accountable.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:18.000
There are more tools and mechanisms that can help you in your brand protection journey.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000
You can find them on Amazon Brand Protection Tools.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.182
Please visit www.

00:04:23.182 --> 00:04:23.909
brandservices.

00:04:23.909 --> 00:04:24.636
amazon.

00:04:24.636 --> 00:04:29.000
com/protect-brand for further details.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:34.250
Amazon provides tools to connect you with customers and help maximise your brand awareness, just

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.000
like in your home store.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:43.895
These tools include A+ content, which enables you to highlight your brand's unique features through

00:04:43.895 --> 00:04:46.000
detailed specifications, product comparisons,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:50.000
and engaging visual media like images and videos.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:56.136
Brand Stores, which offers an immersive platform to captivate customers by introducing them to your

00:04:56.136 --> 00:04:59.000
unique story, mission, and range of products.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:05.375
Vine, which helps you build awareness, trust, and boost sales of new or slow-moving products by

00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:08.000
inviting trusted reviewers in the Amazon Store

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:13.000
to post authentic customer reviews on your freely provided units.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:19.500
Sponsored Brands, which helps boost brand recognition and connect with shoppers effectively using

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.000
sponsored brands advertising.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Finally, we have some exciting news for you.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:30.000
If you're seeking a boost for your new store, Amazon has introduced exciting new seller incentives.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:36.000
As a brand owner, you can unlock potential benefits as you embark on your journey in a new store.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:42.611
Keep in mind that these incentives may be exclusive to certain stores and certain terms and conditions

00:05:42.611 --> 00:05:43.000
apply.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:48.333
So be sure to explore the Seller Central new seller incentives pages for all the details.

00:05:48.333 --> 00:05:51.000
It's an opportunity you won't want to miss.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:51.400
Voila!

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:58.200
Once you transfer your brand and use the power of our brand boosting and protection tools, you're

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:03.000
now prepared to confidently establish your brand's path in your new store.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:07.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store.
